" ╭────────╭ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮─────────╮ "
" │ Work  5│ j/k          move up and down the list                                                          │         │ "
" │        │ ⏎            open: the changes for a result, else the live output                               │         │ "
" │ Needs y│ Tab          next tab (Live, Steps, Diff, Terminal)                                             │         │ "
" │ ● Fix t│ s            steer: send the running agent a note                                               │         │ "
" │   shop │ p            pause the build (again to resume)                                                  │         │ "
" │ ● Add C│ x            stop the build                                                                     │         │ "
" │   shop │ 1-9          answer the agent's question                                                        │─────────┤ "
" │        │ a            accept the result                                                                  │s latest │ "
" │ Working│ r            send the result back, with a note                                                  │terminal │ "
" │ ◐ Upgra│ t            take over: type in a terminal on the latest build (Ctrl-] back)                    │         │ "
" │   shop │ n            new task (Enter: Just code, Tab: plan first)                                       │         │ "
" │ ◐ Rate-│ !            next thing that needs you, oldest first                                            │         │ "
" │   shop │ L/o          split the screen; next panel                                                       │         │ "
" │        │ PgUp/PgDn    scroll; End follows the newest                                                     │         │ "
